\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 In the past, the work groups have been made up mostly of experts from ACIP's liaison members, alongside representatives from federal agencies such as the FDA and the CDC. Liaisons typically represented groups such as the American Medical Association, the American Academy of Pediatrics and the American Pharmacists Association. Members also represent nurses and public health officials and other groups that play a significant role in delivering vaccinations.}
